### BikeMaster API Examples - HTTP Requests

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health

### Lista Rides
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides?page=1&page_size=10&sort=date

### Crea Ride
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-06-15",
  "distance_km": 30.5,
  "duration_minutes": 75,
  "avg_speed_kmh": 24.4,
  "weight_kg": 72,
  "calories": 850,
  "heart_rate_avg": 155,
  "elevation_gain_m": 280
}

### Dettaglio Ride
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides/1

### Elimina Ride
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides/1

### Upload GPX
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/import/gpx
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

<file.gpx>

### Upload FIT
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/import/fit
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

<file.fit>

### Upload Multiplo
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/import/multiple
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

<file1.gpx>
<file2.fit>

### Esporta JSON
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides/export/json

### Esporta CSV
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides/export/csv

### Grafico Velocità
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/charts/speed/1

### Grafico Elevazione
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/charts/elevation/1

### Mappa Interattiva
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides/1/map

### Google Static Map
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides/1/map/google

### Crea Atleta
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/athletes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luca Bianchi",
  "age": 28,
  "weight_kg": 68,
  "height_cm": 172,
  "years_active": 4,
  "weekly_sessions": 5
}

### Dettaglio Atleta
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/athletes/1

### Aggiorna Atleta
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/v1/athletes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weight_kg": 67.5,
  "monthly_hours": 25
}

### Punteggi Atleta
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/scores/athlete/1

### Benchmark Compare
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/benchmark/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "distance_km": 30.5,
  "avg_speed_kmh": 24.4,
  "duration_hours": 1.25
}

### Workout Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/coach/workout?athlete_id=1

### Recovery Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/coach/recovery?fatigue_score=5.5&ride_id=1

### Historical Trends
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/coach/trends

### Lista Knowledge Base
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/knowledge

### Ricerca Knowledge Base
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/knowledge/search?q=recupero

### Statistiche Sistema
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/stats

### Backup Database
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/backup

### Crea Indici
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/indexes

### Reset Demo
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/reset-demo

### Conteggio Rides
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/rides/count